  (text "Cahoots badge V1: a board a Raspberry Pi Pico 2 solders onto. 54 x 86 mm, two layers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "796517e7-5d43-44e9-a8a4-dccb2aefd2de"))
  (text "Connections are by net name: every pin carries a global label. design.py is the source; make_sch.py and make_pcb.py draw it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 40 24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4c3b44fb-cb35-456d-b61e-f93a7894ed95"))
  (text "Panel: GDEY0154D67 on a 24-pin 0.5 mm flex. Pinout and boost circuit from its specification (pp. 7, 28)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 110 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3bfb468f-aae2-4afd-aa36-7b0fa4658ead"))
  (text "Boost: L1 47uH, Q1 switched by the panel's GDR pin, D3 to VGH (+), C3/D1/D2 pump VGL (-). R2 is the current sense." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 160 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "69ce46e6-e54c-4bc6-946b-90bbdbeb927c"))
